{"id":"gp9skzfvqha91lfw8nhkbc8sg","title":"某安全研究员发现PostgreSQL 22年遗留类型混淆漏洞可导致远程代码执行","originalTitle":"Turning a 22-year-old Postgres type-confusion primitive into RCE","summary":"作者在利用pg_clickhouse扩展时发现PostgreSQL存在22年遗留的类型混淆漏洞，通过预编译查询改变字段类型触发崩溃，最终利用类型转换实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有基于PostgreSQL的托管服务，包括Databricks、Google AlloyDB等，修复涉及6个CVE（含主漏洞CVE-2026-6460）和类型版本化等机制改进。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://mehmetince.net/part-3-6-how-i-ended-up-turning-a-22-year-old-postgresql-type-confusion-primitive-into-rce-cve-2026-6460/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T18:22:22.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T19:11:26.942Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T19:11:26.942Z","category":"security-privacy","tags":["新项目","版本发布","安全漏洞","GitHub"],"score":66,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"65bd24eb-731c-4394-a7e0-830c1db95034","title":"PostgreSQL复合类型漏洞（CVE-2026-6460）致远程代码执行"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"65bd24eb-731c-4394-a7e0-830c1db95034","title":"PostgreSQL复合类型漏洞（CVE-2026-6460）致远程代码执行"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"supply-chain-security","name":"供应链与依赖安全"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"},{"slug":"major-release","name":"重大版本发布"},{"slug":"security-fix","name":"安全修复与漏洞"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f5q5TWYvGkrQ","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}